What Is the Renewable Fuel of Non-Biological Origin Verification Services Market?
The renewable fuel of non-biological origin (RFNBO) verification services market covers independent third-party audits and conformity assessments for renewable hydrogen and hydrogen-derived fuels. These services examine renewable electricity sourcing, greenhouse-gas calculations, production records and supply-chain traceability to establish whether fuel production meets applicable certification requirements.

Key Market Drivers
Growing Demand for Certified Renewable Fuels
Regulatory frameworks and renewable energy incentives are increasing the importance of independently verified RFNBO production. Producers seeking access to eligible markets and support programmes require evidence that their electricity sourcing, production methods and emissions calculations meet recognised requirements.

Increasing Need for Independent Audit Services
Hydrogen and e-fuel projects require specialist assessments before and after operations begin. Independent auditors review project documentation, production records and chain-of-custody procedures, creating demand for initial certification audits, surveillance and pre-certification reviews.

