Market Challenges
RFNBO verification involves complex assessments of renewable electricity origin, emissions accounting and fuel traceability. Differences in certification schemes and documentation practices across jurisdictions can make it difficult for providers to deliver consistent assessments across international supply chains.

Market Restraints
Delays in hydrogen project financing and commissioning can postpone certification assignments. Evidence gaps in renewable electricity sourcing and the availability of internal compliance teams may also reduce demand for external pre-certification services.

